{
  "plugins": [
    {
      "manifest": {
        "plugin_id": "dev.crowquillx.anilist-sync",
        "version": "0.8.0",
        "silo_api_version": "v1",
        "supported_platforms": [
          {
            "os": "linux",
            "arch": "amd64"
          },
          {
            "os": "linux",
            "arch": "arm64"
          },
          {
            "os": "darwin",
            "arch": "arm64"
          }
        ],
        "capabilities": [
          {
            "type": "watch_sync_provider.v1",
            "id": "anilist",
            "display_name": "AniList",
            "description": "Syncs completed playback, optionally manual watched marks, and movie ratings to AniList, and imports mapped watch history and movie ratings.",
            "watch_sync_provider": {
              "auth_methods": [
                3
              ],
              "export_watched": true,
              "import_watched": true,
              "supported_media_types": [
                1,
                2
              ],
              "external_id_namespaces": [
                "anilist",
                "imdb",
                "tmdb",
                "tvdb"
              ],
              "max_batch_size": 10,
              "scrobble_playback": true,
              "import_ratings": true,
              "export_ratings": true,
              "rating_export_requires_watched": [
                1
              ],
              "connection_settings": [
                {
                  "key": "sync_manual_watched",
                  "label": "Send manually marked watched items",
                  "description": "Also update AniList when you mark an episode or movie watched without playing it. The plugin's global setting turns this on for every profile.",
                  "type": 1,
                  "default_value": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "only_existing_entries",
                  "label": "Only update anime already on my AniList list",
                  "description": "Skip anime that are not on your AniList list yet, so a wrong match cannot add a title. Add titles to Plan to Watch before watching. The plugin's global setting turns this on for every profile.",
                  "type": 1,
                  "default_value": false
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "watch_sync_provider.v1",
            "id": "anilist-silo",
            "display_name": "AniList with Silo watched check",
            "description": "Checks the selected Silo profile for watched state when a player stops at zero. Connect with an AniList token and a Silo API key. Also syncs movie ratings.",
            "config_schema": [
              {
                "key": "silo",
                "title": "Silo watched verification",
                "description": "Use the same Silo account and profile as this watch-provider connection.",
                "json_schema": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"base_url\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"uri\",\"minLength\":1},\"api_key\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"format\":\"password\",\"minLength\":1},\"profile_id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1}},\"required\":[\"base_url\",\"api_key\",\"profile_id\"]}",
                "required": true,
                "admin_form": {
                  "fields": [
                    {
                      "key": "base_url",
                      "label": "Silo server URL",
                      "description": "The native Silo server URL reachable from the plugin, for example https://silo.example.com. Use HTTPS for remote servers.",
                      "control": 1,
                      "required": true
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "api_key",
                      "label": "Silo API key",
                      "description": "An API key for the Silo account that owns this profile. Stored with this connection.",
                      "control": 3,
                      "required": true,
                      "secret": true
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "profile_id",
                      "label": "Silo profile ID",
                      "description": "The ID of the profile you are connecting. Copy its id from GET /api/v1/profiles.",
                      "control": 1,
                      "required": true
                    }
                  ],
                  "submit_label": "Connect AniList"
                }
              }
            ],
            "watch_sync_provider": {
              "auth_methods": [
                2
              ],
              "export_watched": true,
              "import_watched": true,
              "supported_media_types": [
                1,
                2
              ],
              "external_id_namespaces": [
                "anilist",
                "imdb",
                "tmdb",
                "tvdb"
              ],
              "max_batch_size": 10,
              "scrobble_playback": true,
              "import_ratings": true,
              "export_ratings": true,
              "rating_export_requires_watched": [
                1
              ],
              "connection_settings": [
                {
                  "key": "sync_manual_watched",
                  "label": "Send manually marked watched items",
                  "description": "Also update AniList when you mark an episode or movie watched without playing it. The plugin's global setting turns this on for every profile.",
                  "type": 1,
                  "default_value": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "only_existing_entries",
                  "label": "Only update anime already on my AniList list",
                  "description": "Skip anime that are not on your AniList list yet, so a wrong match cannot add a title. Add titles to Plan to Watch before watching. The plugin's global setting turns this on for every profile.",
                  "type": 1,
                  "default_value": false
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "http_routes.v1",
            "id": "status",
            "display_name": "AniList Sync page",
            "description": "Administrator page with connected accounts, unmapped titles, recent problems and mapping data."
          }
        ],
        "global_config_schema": [
          {
            "key": "provider",
            "title": "AniList provider settings",
            "description": "Watched synchronization behavior.",
            "json_schema": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"sync_manual_watched\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"default\":false},\"playback_completion_percent\":{\"type\":\"number\",\"minimum\":1,\"maximum\":99,\"default\":90},\"import_full_scan\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"default\":false},\"only_existing_entries\":{\"type\":\"boolean\",\"default\":false}}}",
            "required": true,
            "admin_form": {
              "fields": [
                {
                  "key": "sync_manual_watched",
                  "label": "Sync manually marked watched items",
                  "description": "Also send items marked watched without being played, for every profile. Each profile can also turn this on for itself in Settings \u2192 Watch Providers. The existing-entry restriction applies to manual marks too.",
                  "control": 5,
                  "default_value": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "playback_completion_percent",
                  "label": "Playback completion threshold",
                  "description": "Used only when Silo does not say whether playback finished, as older Silo versions do not. Current Silo versions decide with their own watched threshold.",
                  "control": 4,
                  "required": true,
                  "default_value": 90,
                  "validation": {
                    "has_min": true,
                    "min": 1,
                    "has_max": true,
                    "max": 99
                  }
                },
                {
                  "key": "import_full_scan",
                  "label": "Full import rescan",
                  "description": "Turning this on rescans each connected account's whole AniList list once, on its next sync. Later syncs only read changes again. Turn it off and on to rescan again, or use Rescan on the AniList Sync page.",
                  "control": 5,
                  "default_value": false
                },
                {
                  "key": "only_existing_entries",
                  "label": "Only update anime already on AniList",
                  "description": "Skip exports for anime absent from the connected account's list, for every profile. Each profile can also turn this on for itself. Add titles to Plan to Watch before watching. Reduces unwanted additions from false matches; does not filter Silo libraries or watched-history imports.",
                  "control": 5,
                  "default_value": false
                }
              ],
              "submit_label": "Save AniList settings"
            }
          }
        ],
        "http_routes": [
          {
            "id": "status-page",
            "method": "GET",
            "path": "/",
            "access": "admin",
            "navigable": true,
            "navigation_label": "AniList Sync",
            "navigation_kind": "admin"
          },
          {
            "id": "status-json",
            "method": "GET",
            "path": "/status",
            "access": "admin"
          },
          {
            "id": "rescan",
            "method": "POST",
            "path": "/rescan",
            "access": "admin"
          },
          {
            "id": "clear-problems",
            "method": "POST",
            "path": "/clear-problems",
            "access": "admin"
          }
        ],
        "category": "Integrations/Tracking",
        "presentation": {
          "display_name": "AniList Sync",
          "summary": "Syncs anime watch progress and movie ratings with AniList through Silo's watch-provider pipeline.",
          "description_markdown": "Uses Silo's host-owned watch-sync pipeline for encrypted per-profile credentials, durable playback completion delivery, optional manual watched marks, retries, imports, and rich episode identity. Episode exports prefer the daily AniBridge v3 dataset, with an Anime-Lists and ARM fallback. Watch-history imports reverse-map AniList progress through AniBridge. Movie ratings sync both ways. AniList progress is monotonic and ambiguous mappings are rejected rather than guessed. An administrator page lists connected accounts, unmapped titles and recent problems.",
          "setup_markdown": "To connect a profile, open Settings \u2192 Watch Providers \u2192 AniList and select Connect. Silo shows a code and a button that opens the activation page; enter the code, approve access on AniList, and return to Silo. The connection completes automatically and shows your account. AniList tokens last about one year; when one expires, Silo asks you to reconnect. Administrators can check every connection on the AniList Sync page in the admin menu. For players that report a stop at zero, connect the optional AniList with Silo watched check provider instead, using an AniList access token, your Silo server URL, a Silo API key and the current Silo profile ID; see the README. Requires a Silo server from September 24, 2026 or later.",
          "homepage_url": "https://github.com/crowquillx/silo-anilist-sync",
          "source_url": "https://github.com/crowquillx/silo-anilist-sync",
          "support_url": "https://github.com/crowquillx/silo-anilist-sync/issues",
          "changelog_url": "https://github.com/crowquillx/silo-anilist-sync/releases",
          "publisher_name": "crowquillx",
          "publisher_url": "https://github.com/crowquillx",
          "license_spdx": "MIT"
        }
      },
      "repo_url": "https://github.com/crowquillx/silo-anilist-sync",
      "binaries": {
        "linux/amd64": {
          "url": "https://github.com/crowquillx/silo-anilist-sync/releases/download/v0.8.0/plugin-linux-amd64",
